---
args: { milestones: Milestone[], prior?: ProjectDirectorCheckpoint, evidence: Evidence[] }
returns: MilestoneRecoveryPlan
---
Identify late or blocked deliverables, dependencies that remain valid, and learner-specific demonstrations not yet observed. Reassign setup, transport, or group coordination only when the receiving learner has capacity. Preserve the original evidence obligation for any learner whose work was missed.
